{"id": "doc-13-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Non. Il n’y a pas d’infraction de hors-jeu si le joueur reçoit directement le ballon sur une rentrée de touche. [ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-09#1-ballon-hors-du-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 780, "tokens_out": 45, "latency_s": 1.619075652000049, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 277, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-13-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Non. Le hors-jeu n’existe pas lors d’une rentrée de touche [wiki-loi-15-du-football#positionnement-des-autres-joueurs/1].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-15-du-football#positionnement-des-autres-joueurs/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-11-du-football#interpretation/3", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#interpretation/2", "wiki-loi-6-du-football#devoirs/2", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#positionnement-des-autres-joueurs/1", "ifab-loi-15#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 992, "tokens_out": 40, "latency_s": 1.8404818220000152, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 399, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-14-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "On prend en compte la tête, le tronc et les jambes. Les mains et les bras ne comptent pas, jusqu’au bas de l’aisselle pour la limite supérieure du bras. [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1] [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#position-de-hors-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 929, "tokens_out": 77, "latency_s": 1.6940090119999809, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 502, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-14-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les mains et les bras ne comptent pas pour déterminer la position de hors-jeu ; la limite supérieure du bras est le bas de l’aisselle. La tête, le tronc et les jambes sont pris en compte. [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1] [ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-11-du-football#position-de-hors-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#interpretation/2", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#infraction-de-hors-jeu/4"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 920, "tokens_out": 84, "latency_s": 2.0747969239999975, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 531, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-15-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Les extraits ne précisent pas ce qui se passe si un joueur tarde à tirer un coup de pied de but.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/5", "wiki-tirs-au-but#water-polo/1", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#introduction", "wiki-tirs-au-but#handball", "wiki-loi-6-du-football#devoirs/2"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 900, "tokens_out": 32, "latency_s": 1.4177631939999742, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-15-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Les extraits ne précisent pas ce que l’arbitre peut faire face à un gardien qui retarde volontairement un coup de pied de but.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#pendant-les-tirs-au-but/2", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#remplacements-et-exclusions-pendant-les-tirs-au-but", "ifab-loi-12#3-corner/2", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/11", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/11"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 847, "tokens_out": 40, "latency_s": 1.7119439209999996, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 0.0, "mrr": 0.0, "correct": false, "cited": false, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-16-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Au moment du tir, le gardien doit avoir au moins un pied sur ou derrière sa ligne de but, ou au même niveau si ce pied ne touche pas le sol. [ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3"], "retrieved": ["wiki-penalty-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/5", "wiki-penalty-football#avant-que-le-ballon-ne-soit-en-jeu/4", "wiki-penalty-football#avant-que-le-ballon-ne-soit-en-jeu/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 855, "tokens_out": 52, "latency_s": 1.635076990000016, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 355, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-16-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Avant le tir, tu dois rester sur ta ligne de but, face au tireur et entre les poteaux [wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1]. Au moment du tir, tu dois avoir au moins un pied sur ou derrière la ligne [ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3].", "sources": ["wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/2", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/3", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#tirs-au-but/2", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 889, "tokens_out": 68, "latency_s": 1.6645146359999785, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 540, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-17-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque équipe tire cinq fois au début, en alternance. [wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1]", "sources": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/2", "wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/9"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1007, "tokens_out": 34, "latency_s": 1.7883045540000353, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": false, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 360, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-17-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque équipe exécute cinq tirs avant une éventuelle mort subite [wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/9", "wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 850, "tokens_out": 36, "latency_s": 1.4338335479999955, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.3333333333333333, "correct": true, "cited": false, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 380, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-18-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La VAR peut analyser les décisions liées aux buts (but marqué ou non, notamment hors-jeu, faute ou ballon sorti), aux penalties et aux cartons rouges directs pour annihilation d’une occasion manifeste [ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/3] [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/14]. Elle ne peut pas modifier une décision de reprise du jeu une fois le jeu repris [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/14].", "sources": ["ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/3", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/14"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-05#2-decisions-de-l-arbitre/2", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/14", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#critiques/1", "ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/3", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 867, "tokens_out": 116, "latency_s": 2.2473402379999925, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.25, "correct": false, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 623, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-18-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les images peuvent être utilisées pour revoir les décisions concernant un but, un penalty, un carton rouge ou l’identité du joueur sanctionné, ainsi que les incidents graves manqués, uniquement en cas d’erreur manifeste ou d’incident grave manqué [ifab-loi-06#5-arbitres-video/1]. Les vérifications peuvent notamment porter sur des faits comme le hors-jeu, le point de contact ou l’emplacement d’une faute [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-06#5-arbitres-video/1", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12"], "retrieved": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-06#5-arbitres-video/1", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12", "ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/17"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 973, "tokens_out": 109, "latency_s": 2.432985062, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.25, "correct": true, "cited": false, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 582, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-19-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Ken Aston a eu l’idée d’utiliser des cartes de couleur pour signaler un avertissement ou une exclusion [wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1]. Le carton rouge a été inventé après la Coupe du monde de 1966 [wiki-carton-rouge#histoire/1].", "sources": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1", "wiki-carton-rouge#histoire/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-carton-rouge#histoire/1", "wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1", "wiki-carton-jaune#escalade", "wiki-carton-jaune#introduction", "wiki-carton-jaune#rugby/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 721, "tokens_out": 64, "latency_s": 1.6908368500000392, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 517, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-19-situation", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "L’idée d’utiliser des cartes de couleur pour communiquer un avertissement ou une exclusion revient à l’arbitre anglais Ken Aston. [wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1]", "sources": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1", "wiki-carton-rouge#cricket", "wiki-arbitre-football#tenue-de-l-arbitre/2", "wiki-arbitre-football#du-vide-juridique/4", "wiki-carton-jaune#creation/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 796, "tokens_out": 40, "latency_s": 1.3147125300000084, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 376, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
{"id": "doc-20-familier", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La VAR a été introduite en 2017, lors de la Coupe des confédérations [wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#equipes-nationales].", "sources": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#equipes-nationales"], "retrieved": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#equipes-nationales", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#introduction/2", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/3", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/3", "ifab-loi-15#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 787, "tokens_out": 41, "latency_s": 1.3694557850000137, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "trace_path": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": false, "cited": true, "faithful": true, "judge_unsupported": [], "judge_tokens": 303, "trial": 0, "model": "gpt-6-luna"}
